{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "25", "UID": 20025, "OID": 20025.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Right then, that's all we have from this game, and that brings an end to the double-header day. Earlier in the day, Sri Lanka triumphed over West Indies to secure their place in the Super Six, and then India followed suit with a win over Malaysia. Going into the final round of Group A fixtures, the clash between Malaysia and West Indies will be a knockout, with the winner advancing to the Super Six stage.\u00a0The action continues on Wednesday, January 22, with six games spread across Groups B, C, and D. We begin the day with a Group B affair between England and the USA at 2.30 am GMT before our focus shifts to Australia and Nepal in a Group D face off at 6.30 AM GMT. As always, our build-up for both games will begin a lot sooner. See you then. Cheers", "Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:23:39+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Created_Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:23:18+00:00", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "24", "UID": 20024, "OID": 20024.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "The captain of India Women Under-19,\u00a0Niki Prasad\u00a0says that with the weather around,\u00a0they wanted to get the game done quickly but would love to see the team being tested as well. Adds that against Sri Lanka, they would look to perform in the same way. Ends by saying that the one change that they made of bringing\u00a0Vaishnavi Sharma,\u00a0went really well.", "Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:22:28+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Created_Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:22:28+00:00", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "23", "UID": 20023, "OID": 20023.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "The captain of Malaysia Women Under-19, Nur Dania Syuhada\u00a0says that it was a tough game for them but they enjoyed the opportunity of playing against India. Tells that they will look to bounce back in the game against West Indies.", "Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:20:16+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Created_Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:20:16+00:00", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "22", "UID": 20022, "OID": 20022.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Vaishnavi Sharma\u00a0is the PLAYER OF THE MATCH for her five-wicket haul. She says that her plan was simple to bowl on proper lengths. Adds that it was a dream come true for her to pick a fifer on\u00a0debut. She says that Radha Yadav is her role model. Ends by\u00a0thanking the family for their support.", "Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:17:54+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Created_Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:17:42+00:00", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "21", "UID": 20021, "OID": 20021.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Time for the presentation ceremony...", "Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:14:45+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Created_Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:14:45+00:00", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "20", "UID": 20020, "OID": 20020.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "It was always going to be tough for Malaysia against this Indian side, and it proved to be the case. While their batters showed more intent compared to the opening game, with the nerves clearly having settled down, they had no answers to the Indian setup. The\u00a0left-arm spinner\u00a0Vaishnavi Sharma, stood out on debut with an outstanding performance, claiming figures of 5 for 5 from 4 overs, including a hat-trick.", "Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:16:32+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Created_Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:11:42+00:00", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "19", "UID": 20019, "OID": 20019.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "India make it two in two as their title defence gathers pace! The two Indian openers wasted no time in knocking off the modest target of 32. With this victory, the defending champions have successfully booked their place in the Super Six stage. India were near flawless with the ball, but if anything, they will want to cut down on the 10 wides they conceded in this game.", "Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:13:50+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Created_Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:09:10+00:00", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "18", "UID": 20018, "OID": 20018.0, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,286,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "108062", "Bowler_Name": "Suabika", "Batsman": "83660", "Batsman_Name": "Trisha Gongadi", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "FOUR! That's it! A convincing win for India Women Under-19!\u00a0Fuller one, on off, Trisha Gongadi\u00a0stands tall and pumps it over mid on for a boundary.\u00a0And in a flash, in just 2.5 overs, India Women Under-19\u00a0win by 10 wickets!", "Summary": {"Score": "32/0", "Over": "2.5", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "83660", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "27", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "108890", "Runs": "4", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "108062", "Overs": "1.5", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0", "Ball_bowled": "11", "Dot_balls": "5"}], "Balls": "17", "Current_runrate": "11.29"}, "Timestamp": "2025-01-21T08:07:19+00:00", "Non_Striker": "108890", "Non_Striker_Name": "Kamalini G", "Score": "32/0", "Batsman_Runs": "4", "Bowler_Conce